  "correct_coefficient_caveat": "Calibration made small numerical changes when coefficients were correct. At 64 steps in-distribution, four settings had higher calibrated error with pointwise intervals excluding zero (all Allen\u2013Cahn stages and FitzHugh\u2013Nagumo). Absolute errors remained around 1e-12 to 1e-11. This prevents a claim that calibration always improves an already-correct solver.",
